// Preferences (Ctrl+K): the home page and pictures. The proxy and the
// connection itself are in Connection settings (shared with PsiTerm and
// PsiMail). Screen greys... opens the greys screen shared with PsiTerm and
// PsiMail (ssh/psigreyui.cpp; docs/display.md) on top; the dialog is still
// there when it closes.
// (0.88) File > Open in full browser: the page showing, in a real browser
// (Carbonyl, or w3m) on one of PsiTerm's saved servers, shown in PsiTerm.
// The server is a name from PsiTerm's list; the program is run there with
// the address. Help > Ways to connect says how to install them.
RESOURCE DIALOG r_pw_full_dialog
	{
	title="Open in full browser";
	flags=EEikDialogFlagWait;
	buttons=R_EIK_BUTTONS_CANCEL_OK;
